## Evidence

Every other language's suggester refuses words over 40 letters: Polish ([crates/proof/src/pl/suggest.rs#L202](https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/00bc6a4b028013b2dfb0e85e8b326aeed3ecff6d/crates/proof/src/pl/suggest.rs#L202)), and likewise Russian, Czech (reused by Indonesian), Croatian, Italian, Portuguese and English (`lib.rs:488`):
```rust
if n == 0 || n > MAX_LETTERS || max == 0 || d.is_empty() || word.contains(char::is_whitespace) {
```
Turkish dispatches with no such gate ([lib.rs#L741](https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/00bc6a4b028013b2dfb0e85e8b326aeed3ecff6d/crates/proof/src/lib.rs#L741)). `tr::suggest_with` checks only emptiness ([crates/proof/src/tr/suggest.rs#L56-L59](https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/00bc6a4b028013b2dfb0e85e8b326aeed3ecff6d/crates/proof/src/tr/suggest.rs#L56-L59)):
```rust
pub fn suggest_with(d: &TrDict, word: &str, max: usize) -> Vec<String> {
    if word.is_empty() || max == 0 {
        return Vec::new();
    }
```
Then, for a word of n letters ([#L106-L176](https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/00bc6a4b028013b2dfb0e85e8b326aeed3ecff6d/crates/proof/src/tr/suggest.rs#L106-L176)):
- transpositions and deletions build n candidates;
- substitutions and insertions each build about 29n candidates;
- each candidate is a fresh O(n) `String` passed to `TrDict::contains`.

`generate_diacritic_variants` (`#L189-L231`) also extends its variant list to full length.

`TrDict::contains` has no length gate. It collects `char_indices()` for the whole word and loops up to `max_suffix_len`, a value taken from the installed `.aff` file ([crates/proof/src/tr/dict.rs#L53](https://g…

