Expected behavior: The context menu "Paste" action should call the clipboard provider and insert text at the current cursor position in the field.

Technical Hint / Code Fix Suggestion (Rust / egui):
If a custom context menu is bound to the TextEdit widget, ensure the "Paste" menu item explicitly fetches text from ui.ctx().output_mut(|o| ...) or the system clipboard state, rather than triggering a document-level paste action:

Rust
